<title>UK: STOLT-NIELSEN TAKES DELIVERY OF CHEMICAL TANKER.</title>
<headline>STOLT-NIELSEN TAKES DELIVERY OF CHEMICAL TANKER.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stolt Parcel Tankers Inc, a subsidiary of Stolt-Nielsen SA, said it has taken delivery of the fourth in a series of seven 37,000 dwt chemical carriers being built by Danyard, a subsidiary of Denmark's J. Lauritzen Holding A/S.</p>
</text>
